Structure of FastAPI
main.py -> contains the main code of the FastAPI app
requirements.txt -> contains the dependencies of the FastAPI app
schemas.py -> contains the Pydantic models of the FastAPI app, for validations

alembic
  -> Migration tool for SQLAlchemy, that helps manage database schema change
    -> alembic.ini -> configuration file for alembic
    -> env.py -> script for managing the database schema
    -> versions -> contains the migration files
    -> README -> contains the instructions for using alembic

initiate alembic
    alembic init alembic - this will create the alembic folder
Create migration
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Initial migration" - this will create a migration file in the versions folder
Apply migration
    alembic upgrade head - this will apply the migration to the database
Downgrade migration
    alembic downgrade -1 - this will revert the last migration from the database


alembic revision - create a new migration
--autogenerate - detects newchanges in the models
-m "Initial migration" - message for the migration file

The generated migration file has two functions, upgrade and downgrade. The upgrade function applies the changes to the database, 
while the downgrade function reverts the changes.

"""